{
  "_recipe": "API-006 Fetch activity history",
  "_contract_version": "2.0 (option B: bundled users + events, single events cursor)",
  "_notes": [
    "Trigger changes: (1) DELETE the continuation_token PATH parameter; (2) ADD continuation_token to the request BODY schema (one transport per endpoint); (3) REPLACE the 200 body schema with response_200_body_schema below.",
    "Step 2 find_users: continuation_token input must be CLEARED (users are unpaginated by contract; the trigger token belongs to the events cursor).",
    "Step 4 mapping: ok=true (static); users <- find_users Users list pill; users_truncated_token <- find_users Continuation token pill; activity_records <- lookup_events records list pill; continuation_token <- lookup_events Continuation token pill.",
    "Step 3 lookup_events: continuation_token input now maps from the request BODY pill instead of path_params.",
    "Step 6 mapping (500): ok=false (static); error_message <- catch error datapills.",
    "users[] field names deliberately mirror performed_by (user_id/user_name/user_email/status/groups) so the payload speaks one vocabulary."
  ],
